      "details": {
        "zh": "项目基于 ROS Noetic，集成 PX4 SITL、Gazebo Classic、MID360 仿真、Faster-LIO 定位以及 Qt/RViz 操作台，衔接全局 A* 路线与 EGO 局部规划。支持在线建图、加载地图、区域选择、巡检路线与相机关键帧记录。根据仓库说明，项目仍处于仿真验证阶段，新增巡检功能尚未完成飞行验收，实机验收也尚未完成。",
        "en": "This ROS Noetic workspace integrates PX4 SITL, Gazebo Classic, simulated MID360 sensing, Faster-LIO localization, and a Qt/RViz console. It connects global A* routes with EGO local planning and includes online mapping, map loading, area selection, inspection routes, and camera keyframe recording. The repository describes ongoing simulation validation; flight acceptance for the new inspection functionality and real-hardware acceptance are still pending.",
      },
