      "details": {
        "zh": "项目面向机场清扫车，采用 Jetson/J6M 双机架构。当前仓库版本将四路相机、YOLO11-GAM 检测、地面二维定位与 BEV、导航逐点清扫及区域覆盖流程集成到 Qt 操作界面，并结合激光定位与导航模块。项目包含复现、部署与实验记录；覆盖路线的离线验证不等同于完整实车跟踪验收，具体运行状态以仓库文档为准。",
        "en": "This airport sweeping robot uses a Jetson/J6M dual-host architecture. The current repository integrates four cameras, YOLO11-GAM detection, ground-plane localization and BEV, navigation-assisted point cleaning, and area coverage in a Qt interface, alongside LiDAR localization and navigation modules. It includes reproduction, deployment, and experiment documentation. Offline coverage-route validation is distinct from complete on-vehicle tracking acceptance; consult the repository for current status.",
      },
